using the two or the three or the four,

00:06:00.600 --> 00:06:03.800
whatever, you start to be able to build

00:06:01.880 --> 00:06:05.160
these really complicated things. And

00:06:03.800 --> 00:06:07.120
it's the same thing with carbon because

00:06:05.160 --> 00:06:08.800
it can make these four bonds, it really

00:06:07.120 --> 00:06:10.760
allows it to make all of these different

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:12.400
kinds of molecules. Um, and we think

00:06:10.760 --> 00:06:14.520
that we see the evidence of a lot of

00:06:12.400 --> 00:06:16.120
that going on in Titan's atmosphere. So,

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:17.919
we already have a bunch of different

00:06:16.120 --> 00:06:19.680
simple little LEGO structures in the

00:06:17.919 --> 00:06:22.280
atmosphere. We just want to know how

00:06:19.680 --> 00:06:24.240
