00:06:22.280 --> 00:06:25.800
whether or not that is, you know, kind

00:06:24.240 --> 00:06:28.520
of similar to the level of complexity

00:06:25.800 --> 00:06:30.800
that we see on on Earth, which might

00:06:28.520 --> 00:06:33.320
indicate the possibility for the

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:36.400
