from these processes.

00:06:41.440 --> 00:06:45.640
And so, you know, the more opportunities

00:06:43.240 --> 00:06:47.760
we have to be able to explore places,

00:06:45.640 --> 00:06:49.560
the fewer limitations we have on

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:52.680
answering our science questions, which

00:06:49.560 --> 00:06:52.680
is really important.

