me, it might move slightly down my list.

00:20:03.240 --> 00:20:07.640
For me, it was almost a coming of age

00:20:05.880 --> 00:20:10.560
for my team, but also for the

00:20:07.640 --> 00:20:12.840
instrument. You know, people say to me,

00:20:10.560 --> 00:20:16.000
"Why do you explore planets?" And for

00:20:12.840 --> 00:20:18.080
me, we are explorers. Humankind have

00:20:16.000 --> 00:20:19.600
always been explorers. When we didn't

00:20:18.080 --> 00:20:21.880
know much about the Earth, people would

